    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vārus</span></b> , i, m.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a surname</i>,
			esp. in the gens Quintilia; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">e. g. P. Quintilius Varus,</span>”
				<i>defeated by Arminius</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 117</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Tib. 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 1, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 43</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">1, 55</span></i>; 1, 60 al.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vārĭānus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a Varus</i>, <i>Varian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clades,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 23</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Tib. 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Calig. 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">31</span></i>.</div>
